# Sunken Citadel: "This land enters tapped. As it enters, choose a color. {T}: Add one mana of the chosen color."
# Bot1 plays it on turn 1 and chooses red: it enters tapped, and red is kept on it (CR 614.12a, 607.2d). On turn 3 the
# color is still red: its first ability offers red and no other color (CR 106.5), and the {R} it adds is unrestricted,
# so it pays for Lightning Bolt.

